aggregate concentration. Their evolution is governed by:

\[
\frac{\partial m}{\partial t}
= D_m \nabla^2 m
- k_{\text{nuc}} m^2
- k_{\text{elong}} m f
- \Gamma_{\text{clear}}(\mathbf{x},t)\, m
\]

\[
\frac{\partial f}{\partial t}
= D_f \nabla^2 f
+ k_{\text{nuc}} m^2
+ k_{\text{elong}} m f
- \Gamma_{\text{clear}}(\mathbf{x},t)\, f
